abstract: "Interactive illustration of the ORBIT constraint-gated procedure. A six-domain screening score flags co-occurring warning signals; a decision gate compares usable headroom with a dated requirement; the response compares the expected cost of monitoring, targeted inquiry and immediate action. Example values are invented. The tool is not an empirically validated model."
keywords:
  - management control
  - variance investigation
  - decision gate
  - headroom
  - managerial attention
